{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-10","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：比例","englishTitle":"Of magnitudes which have a ratio to the same, that which has a greater ratio is greater; and that to which the same has a greater ratio is less.","book":5,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","contentId":"euclid-5-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccb77d2d329d2932a53613146b3be17dc7ca2f18a0f8bb39fb4a5c2afb3a3eb8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-10.statement","euclid-5-10.construction.1","euclid-5-10.proof.1","euclid-5-10.proof.2","euclid-5-10.proof.3","euclid-5-10.proof.4","euclid-5-10.proof.5","euclid-5-10.proof.6","euclid-5-10.proof.7","euclid-5-10.proof.8","euclid-5-10.proof.9","euclid-5-10.conclusion","euclid-5-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25a7f4dc86582daaf9c104d40347d6963888e4da5fc97fb7ddbcaa1c23eed530","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Of magnitudes which have a ratio to the same, that which has a greater ratio is greater; and that to which the same has a greater ratio is less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与同一数值相比,较大的比数值更大;而与较大的比数值相比,则更少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca2f24a0fd767b6d581b2fc51959008ac861445863398a492363b5c405cf2cbf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A have to C a greater ratio than B has to C; I say that A is greater than B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A到Ca 较大的比到C;我说A比B要多。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76d4c0fcfde9239fbfe97679d7c166953a153f50cb2750cd2e1abf22c4f7be86","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, A is either equal to B or less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是,A等于或少于B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f292f69402a6e2f943949648b80685e81b12fc94275263a955eb779acf379e41","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now A is not equal to B; for in that case each of the magnitudes A, B would have had the same ratio to C; [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)] but they have not; therefore A is not equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在，A 不等于 B；因为如果二者相等，A 与 C 之比和 B 与 C 之比就会相等，但事实上这两个比并不相等，因此 A 不等于 B。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3959ea9392a0a4a8ca20207518d3d11503f16c78b4007ccb0b446e1f5f17fd96","citations":["euclid-5-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Nor again is A less than B; for in that case A would have had to C a less ratio than B has to C; [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)] but it has not; therefore A is not less than B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A也低于B;因为在这种情况下,A本可比B少C,但比例却低于C;因此,A不少于B。 [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c7cbb9c19b899fb204875477f4cf7fd02546bb494d2fbbb6876a2365fe9c871c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved not to be equal either; therefore A is greater than B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,两者不相等;因此,A项大于B项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"337be0a45f2785c94b4fccdef24b4e7e64d778201064924f50eeb8862a172498","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let C have to B a greater ratio than C has to A; I say that B is less than A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C到Ba 较大的比到A之间;我说B小于A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"826af15459437113365b98c31508eb6d53d96f84e0c0f2f298fd165958d54e19","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, it is either equal or greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果不是,它就是平等或更大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97f26994ee1ac57cfb116bf1bb212da078571bd86eab17279dbb09cc087007f2","citations":["euclid-5-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now B is not equal to A; for in that case C would have had the same ratio to each of the magnitudes A, B; [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)] but it has not; therefore A is not equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在B不等于A;因为在这种情况下,C的数值与A、B等的数值的比相同;但没有;因此,A的数值不等于B。 [[V. 7](/principles/euclid-5-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"514fb50cd3ba10b39aa1d0ca47781985bcdbbfe40432724a55c16146c9e8c0af","citations":["euclid-5-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Nor again is B greater than A; for in that case C would have had to B a less ratio than it has to A; [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)] but it has not; therefore B is not greater than A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B也高于A;因为在这种情况下,C比A少B;但没有;因此,B不大于A。 [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a00c4a8cd2b65fe052c7ecdd93bce141d368d605273ffeecde19eadfda988bec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved that it is not equal either; therefore B is less than A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,两者不相等;因此,B项低于A项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-10.source","contentId":"euclid-5-10","revisionId":"euclid-5-10@raw-ccb77d2d329d2932","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80b8624c8b92b36769354b3968b94b4fae08460f952cfdf35135680f6b4a47d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-10:euclid-5-7:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-10.proof.2","euclid-5-10.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-7","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.10","sou